  "scope": "Actual capacity-row length scan, exact old binary dimension word, two actual multiplications to construct 3*n^2, actual quotient producing 2/(3*n^2), and allocated delta/fuel pair. The same physical run pays all instruction operations and terminal halt with an original-row-length polynomial budget, and retains the original row. Exact equality to BinaryFractionalCore.parameters and the old dimension helper includes raw bit fields; empty dimension uses the original zero-divisor convention. No supplied dimension, square, fuel, delta or quotient output. Represented row and initial heap/address bounds remain inputs; composition into the complete packing run, raw graph preparation and outer dispatch remain separate.",
